<html>

<head>
<meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, minimum-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no" />
<meta name="screen-orientation" content="portrait">
<title>出错啦！无法打开小米VIP</title>

<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://rs.vip.miui.com/h5/error/error180327.css" />

</head>
<body>

<div id='main_page' class="error-pager">
   <img class="error-icon"  src='https://rs.vip.miui.com/h5/error/images/icon.webp'>
   <div class='notice-info'>打开的姿势不对~ </div>
   <div id='info' class='notice-info1'>请在小米应用商店升级小米VIP版本，或将MIUI系统升级</div>
   <div class='notice-info1'>Ps：小米手机才可打开【我的小米】哟~ </div>
   <div id='prompt' class='update-prompt hide'></div>
   <div id='button' class='update-button'></div>
</div>

<script type="text/javascript" src="https://rs.vip.miui.com/h5/error/error180327.js"></script>

</body>
</html>